ssssssssssssssssssss
@sprite mbs_gyeongho.pix caught 150 121
@sprite mbs_overdub.pix idle_0 104 100
@darkness K 0.6
@light 160 130 40
@sprite mbs_fx_tear.pix tear 0 0 over
